The decoders are new code, except src/codec/ccitt*.rs (see below).

tests/parity/go/ holds a test-only Go oracle that is not part of the crate:
upstream/ is github.com/dobbo-ca/tiff-go (MIT), and deps/ holds the
sources it builds with: deflate-go and jpeg-go (Apache-2.0, see their
LICENSE files; packages tiff-go does not import are left out) and
golang.org/x/image/ccitt (BSD-3-Clause, LICENSE and PATENTS alongside).

src/codec/ccitt.rs and src/codec/ccitt_tables.rs port golang.org/x/image/ccitt (reader.go,
table.go, gen.go) at x/image v0.47.0, which carries this licence:

